<label for="aIn">Any infection or pregnancy?</label><select id="aIn"><option value="no">No</option><option value="yes">Yes</option></select>
<label for="aAn">Attendant travelling with patient</label><input id="aAn" maxlength="80" placeholder="Name"><input id="aAp" type="tel" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="Attendant mobile (10 digits)" style="margin-top:6px">
<label for="aDh">Drop hospital name (and city)</label><input id="aDh" maxlength="120">
<label for="aFit">Doctor's fitness-to-fly certificate (photo, compulsory)</label><input id="aFit" type="file" accept="image/*">
<label for="aRep">Medical reports / discharge summary (photo, compulsory)</label><input id="aRep" type="file" accept="image/*">
<label for="aBed">Drop hospital bed confirmation (photo, optional)</label><input id="aBed" type="file" accept="image/*">
<p class="note" style="margin-top:6px">Today you pay only a small approval fee. Our team gets the airline's approval, then you pay the balance and we handle pickup, flight and hospital drop. If the airline does not approve, you get a full refund. If you cancel yourself, the approval fee is not refunded (see the refund table on the payment page).</p></div>
